<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Nothing Good</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Nothing Good</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0ub4mppYpkLhOOv6rYV4sp</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.843" end="00:17.741">Diamond heart formed under the pressure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.741" end="00:21.663">Been keeping secrets long as I can remember</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.663" end="00:24.800">Holding me down, shaking me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.800" end="00:28.291">Did I only dream, or did you put me to sleep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.291" end="00:30.461" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.461" end="00:34.657">Tread soft on my broken glass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.657" end="00:38.099">Never slept with a light on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.099" end="00:43.009">I coloured me in, couldn't keep in the lines, now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.009" end="00:45.011">Can you see them running?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.011" end="00:46.511" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.061" end="00:48.535">You give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.535" end="00:53.188">Nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.188" end="00:56.883">Yeah, you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.883" end="01:00.297">Nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.297" end="01:03.655" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.655" end="01:07.815">The water's deep, and the water is wide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.815" end="01:11.606">Me and my shadow walking side by side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.606" end="01:16.169">Spinning too fast as time moves slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.169" end="01:19.797">I'm still here trying to let this go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.797" end="01:21.297" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.611" end="01:28.611">Inside, I'm trying to smother the fire</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.677" end="01:34.843">But year after year, I've been burning alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.843" end="01:36.343" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.893" end="01:38.582">'Cause you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.582" end="01:43.264">Nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.264" end="01:46.936">Yeah, you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.936" end="01:51.551">Nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.551" end="01:59.551" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.318" end="02:13.516">Somewhere in all of this, I'm still here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.516" end="02:15.016">Just like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.483" end="02:17.692">Somewhere in all of this, I'm still here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.692" end="02:19.192">Just like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.717" end="02:21.887">Somewhere in all of this, I'm still here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.887" end="02:23.387">Just like you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.836" end="02:24.783">Somewhere in all of this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.783" end="02:26.283" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.249" end="02:28.692">You give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.692" end="02:33.373">Nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.373" end="02:36.997">Yeah, you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.997" end="02:41.688">Nothing, nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.688" end="02:45.340">Yeah, you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.340" end="02:50.082">Nothing, nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.082" end="02:53.700">Yeah, you give me nothing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.700" end="02:58.015">Nothing, nothing good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.015" end="02:59.515" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.214" end="03:00.485">Good, good, good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.485" end="03:02.361">Somewhere in all of this, I'm still here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.361" end="03:04.628">Good, good, good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.628" end="03:06.543">Somewhere in all of this, I'm still here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.543" end="03:10.543">Good, good, good</p></div></body></tt>